      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    initial_investment = 120.0  # millions of dollars\n    gross_return_rate = 0.35\n    hurdle_rate = 0.05\n    management_fee_rate = 0.02\n    incentive_fee_rate = 0.20\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    gross_profit = initial_investment * gross_return_rate\n    year_end_aum = initial_investment + gross_profit\n\n    management_fee = year_end_aum * management_fee_rate\n    hurdle_profit = initial_investment * hurdle_rate\n\n    incentive_fee_base = gross_profit - hurdle_profit - management_fee\n    incentive_fee = incentive_fee_base * incentive_fee_rate\n\n    net_return = gross_profit - management_fee - incentive_fee\n    answer = round(net_return, 2)\n\n    # return answer\n    return answer\n```",
